Audit semantics

AreaVersion is append-only for retained areas. Explicit permanent deletion physically removes both the Area row and all its AreaVersion rows within the same transaction. The audit guarantee is scoped to retained areas; it does not constitute a globally immutable ledger. DESIGN.md's Versioning and Audit Trail sections are updated to state this boundary explicitly.

No PURGED status or PURGED ChangeType was introduced.

